{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n天王郭富城（Aaron）為宣傳啟德跨年演唱會，在今晚（15日）播出的TVB節目《J Music》中，罕有地公開了演唱會的幕後拍攝花絮！片中Aaron連換多套色彩鮮艷的戰衣，氣場全開，更驚爆今次服裝設計由張叔平（阿叔）一手包辦，而且阿叔更為他「破例」！究竟是甚麼原因令這位殿堂級美術指導作出改變？\n</p>\n<h2>郭富城自信爆棚拍花絮 造型多變型到炸裂</h2>\n<p>在曝光的幕後花絮中，郭富城雖然已是樂壇天王，但狀態依然保持在巔峰。他身穿多套色彩鮮艷、設計前衛的服裝，在鏡頭前大擺各種有型甫士，姿態自信，氣場強大到溢出螢幕。無論是凌厲的眼神還是充滿張力的肢體動作，都散發著無窮魅力，一舉一動都型到炸裂，完全不輸時下年輕偶像，展現出其對舞台表演的極致追求和專業態度。</p>\n<h2>郭富城揭張叔平破例合作 驚喜包辦Dancer造型</h2>\n<p>今次演唱會的服裝由著名美術指導張叔平（阿叔）親自操刀，郭富城形容這次合作是「最難得」的一次。他在節目中興奮地分享：「以往阿叔只係做我嘅歌衫同造型，但呢段時間佢連我啲 Dancer 嘅造型都一齊諗埋，以前係分開嘅。」這個意想不到的轉變，意味著整個演唱會的視覺風格將會更加統一和完整。Aaron坦言對阿叔的投入感到非常感動，這次破天荒的全面合作，無疑為演唱會的服裝造型帶來了前所未有的期待值。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚天王氣場 期待張叔平視覺盛宴</h2>\n<p>幕後花絮一出，立即引起網民熱烈討論，不少人大讚郭富城狀態大勇。網民紛紛留言：「完全唔似就快60歲，呢個狀態太屈機！」、「啲衫好sharp醒，城城完全carry到！」、「眼神超有戲，不愧係舞台王者！」。對於張叔平的「破例」合作，網民更是期待值爆燈：「阿叔出手，必屬佳品！今次連Dancer衫都理埋，成個畫面肯定好靚！」、「好想快啲睇到成個團隊嘅造型，一定係一場視覺盛宴！」、「天王加殿堂級美指，呢個組合無得輸！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_9977951516af921d6aaf89.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_9977951516af921d6aaf89.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_8091848606af921db78c83.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_8091848606af921db78c83.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_3005608956af921e4216cd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_3005608956af921e4216cd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_16146933966af921ebd9aa6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_16146933966af921ebd9aa6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_21410962236af921f192c35.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_21410962236af921f192c35.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_9698567476af921f7b7cf8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_9698567476af921f7b7cf8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_5662953696af921fd0a88a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_5662953696af921fd0a88a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_1945761296af922032e1c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_1945761296af922032e1c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_9971332586af9220a6ff93.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_9971332586af9220a6ff93.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_19298113136af92213c9daf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_19298113136af92213c9daf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>",